    },
    "You will be notified when your watch's battery level reaches %lld%%." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du wirst benachrichtigt, wenn der Batteriestand deiner Uhr %lld%% erreicht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're %lld steps away from your goal, which is about %@ %@. Once you complete your goal, you'll have burned %lld kcal and walked for about %@!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du bist noch %1$lld Schritte von deinem Ziel entfernt, was etwa %2$@ %3$@ enstpricht. Wenn du dein Ziel erreichst, hast du %4$lldkcal verbrannt und bist etwa %5$@ gelaufen!"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You're %1$lld steps away from your goal, which is about %2$@ %3$@. Once you complete your goal, you'll have burned %4$lld kcal and walked for about %5$@!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're almost there! A quick %@ %@ walk should get you to your goal. It should only take you about %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du hast es fast geschafft! Ein kurzer %1$@ %2$@ langer Spaziergang sollte dich zu deinem Ziel bringen. Es sollte nur etwa %3$@ dauern."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You're almost there! A quick %1$@ %2$@ walk should get you to your goal. It should only take you about %3$@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're making great progress! You have about %@ %@ to walk. At your current pace, you'll hit your goal in %@." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Du machst gute Fortschritte! Du hast noch etwa %1$@ %2$@ zu gehen. Bei deinem aktuellen Tempo erreichst du dein Ziel in %3$@."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "You're making great progress! You have about %1$@ %2$@ to walk. At your current pace, you'll hit your goal in %3$@."
